# An allowlist: the build context holds only what the Dockerfile copies, so runtime state, caches,
# secrets, the tests and the docs never reach the image. tests/test_build.py checks that the
# exceptions below match the Dockerfile's COPY lines.
*
!requirements.txt
!entrypoint.sh
!LICENSE
!youtube_manager/
# Bytecode, and any database or log written inside the package, stay out too.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/*.log
